title: BottomDialogueUITest
---
Prince: The new bottom dialogue box stays low so the scene can still breathe.
Prince: It can hold longer text without taking over the whole screen. The safe area and compact height should keep it usable on mobile.
Munir: Now choose a response from the focused carousel.
-> Ask about conversation topics
    Prince: Can we talk about the topics Prince still needs to understand?
    Munir: Yes. The carousel can be reused for topic selection later.
-> Ask about activities
    Prince: Could this same option picker choose activities?
    Munir: It can. After this Yarn node ends, the test scene opens standalone activity-style options.
-> Say nothing for now
    Prince: I will keep listening for now.
    Munir: Silence can be a decision too.
-> Give a careful answer
    Prince: I want to answer carefully without making the option label carry the whole sentence.
    Munir: Good. Long option lists should scroll without growing taller.
Prince: Yarn options are complete. Next, the same carousel will open without dialogue text.
===
